[{"id":168679183,"discussion_id":"aceefb217270823efb033be0639af384a122ae79","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| moe | ✅ [*黄俊健*](https://gitcode.com/monologue815), [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (2/2) | ✅ [*songkai111*](https://gitcode.com/songkai111) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n wuxiyuan, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-04-17T16:50:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-23T11:21:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168679339,"discussion_id":"1d8920223e4c601849711ae03087c3e6c994f295","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化MoE算子中专家令牌计算的Tiling（分片）逻辑。核心问题是，当系统提供的物理核心数过多时，可能导致资源分配不均和潜在的性能下降。为此，本次修改引入了核心数上限机制，以提升算子在多样化硬件配置下的鲁棒性和性能一致性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案聚焦于 `Tiling4MoeComputeExpertTokens` 函数。主要改动是定义了一个最大核心数常量 `MAX_CORE_NUM`（阈值为64），并在获取平台总核心数后，通过 `min` 函数计算出一个受控的 `effectiveCoreNum`。后续所有基于核心数的负载均衡与循环计算均基于此有效核心数进行，从而确保了资源分配的优化和计算性能的稳定。","created_at":"2026-04-17T16:50:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-17T16:50:31+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168722510,"discussion_id":"610fd14cc2c12c41f8891ac39f13b073df3f088a","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-04-18T11:03:45+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-18T11:03:45+08:00","user":{"id":"68ca5a04d94db731d1dc6287","login":"wuxiyuan","object_id":"68ca5a04d94db731d1dc6287","name":"wuxiyuan","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuxiyuan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":168722551,"discussion_id":"fb7f57ba925043d712ac450b8a351f2d192b13b6","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=7ea0a15c6da64d5e9166198a95ce94a2&projectName=CANN'>7ea0a15c6da64d5e9166198a95ce94a2</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>Compile_Ascend_X86</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=3537b826c3c54622a4fd365051123f9e&pipelineRunId=7ea0a15c6da64d5e9166198a95ce94a2&projectName=CANN>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/4312/cann-ops-transformer-experimental_linux-x86_64.run>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        